 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=BE=93=E5=85=A5=EF=BC=8C=E8=AE=A9rtt=E8=83=BD=E5=9C=A8sdram?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=B8=AD=E8=BF=90=E8=A1=8C?=
